# Log into HackStock BBS, ack all Hit-a-key prompts, then press H
# ---- SSH banner ack + BBS login sequence ----
hit 5
# BBS asks for BBS username/password (ANSI login screen)
wait 3
line ch4zm
wait 2
line Time4phreaking!
# Ack Hit-a-key errors after login (mainmenu.msg is broken; still functional)
hit 8
# Post-a-oneliner? → N
send N
wait 1
hit 4
# Read your mail? → N (we already saw it)
send N
wait 1
hit 4
# Should be at main menu prompt now — the "Command:" prompt on SBBS is bare
# Send H (secret PloverNet portal from The_Mentor's mail)
wait 2
send H
wait 4
hit 6
wait 30
